DIFME D3 (2026-11-23): on-us transfers. When the payee's partyIdInfo.fspId is the tenant itself and the tenant
configures an "onus-transfer" flow (bpmns.tenants[].flows), the channel starts that flow (DifmeOnUsTransfer: local
quote, block, payee deposit, all in the tenant's Fineract) instead of "payment-transfer" (PayerFundTransfer through
the Mojaloop switch). Without the setting, behaviour is upstream's.
